{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 5, :comments ["<b>And all the days of Adam were nine hundred years and thirty years.</b> Not with exact precision, but even one day in a year counts as a year — and so for all of them." "<b>And he died.</b> In all the generations until Noah it is written thus, to inform that death was brought upon them because of the serpent's instigation; from Noah onward it does not matter."], :book :genesis, :voice :chizkuni, :lang :en, :chapter 5, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-30T15:03:02.196965641Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}